  "recommended_action_space": "continuous-flow hybrid (mode in {charge, discharge, bypass} + continuous flow_rate_kg_s within flow_envelope_kg_s) \u2014 the pump range (0.010-0.050 kg/s) is continuous, so a discrete-only action space would discard usable control resolution",
