  "observation_notes": "The tank is stratified: delivery temperature is the TOP node, the collector inlet is the BOTTOM node. recoverable_energy_above_45C_kWh is the WP1 E_rec,45 quantity (in Uttarakhand the threshold is the 50 C delivery target; the field keeps its cross-state name) and needs an estimator (not a raw sensor). Loop flow sets stratification, not collector heat, in this model.",
  "safety_shield": {
